              "value": "禁止我国境内的组织、个人与其进行有关交易、合作等活动",
              "lang": "zh",
              "script": "Hani",
              "is_primary": true
            },
            {
              "value": "Prohibit organizations and individuals in China from engaging in transactions, cooperation or related activities with the entity",
              "lang": "en",
              "script": "Latn",
              "is_primary": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "effect_type": "entry_ban",
          "scope": "full",
          "description": [
            {
              "value": "对其本人不予签发签证、不准入境",
              "lang": "zh",
              "script": "Hani",
              "is_primary": true
            },
            {
              "value": "Visa ban for the individual, prohibiting entry",
              "lang": "en",
              "script": "Latn",
              "is_primary": false
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "reasons": [
        {
          "category": "other",
          "description": [
            {
              "value": "近年来频繁采取干涉中国内政、损害中方利益的言行，并于近期率团窜访中国台湾地区，严重违反一个中国原则和中美三个联合公报规定，严重损害中国主权和领土完整，向\"台独\"分裂势力发出严重错误信号。",
              "lang": "zh",
              "script": "Hani",
              "is_primary": true
            },
            {
              "value": "Frequently engaged in actions interfering in China's internal affairs and harming China's interests, and recently led a delegation to visit China's Taiwan region, seriously violating the One-China principle and the three China-US joint communiqués, seriously damaging China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, and sending seriously wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.",
              "lang": "en",
              "script": "Latn",
              "is_primary": false
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "period": {
        "effective_date": "2023-04-13",
        "is_indefinite": false
      },
      "status": "active",
      "reference_number": "3-michael-mccaul",
      "announcement": {
        "title": "关于对美国反华议员迈克·麦考尔采取反制措施的决定",
        "url": "https://www.mfa.gov.cn/wjb_673085/zfxxgk_674865/gknrlb/fzcqdcs/202304/t20230413_11058780.shtml",
        "published_date": "2023-04-13",
        "published_time": "17:36",
        "document_type": "中华人民共和国外交部令",
        "document_id": "第3号",
        "signatory": "外交部",
        "authority": "中华人民共和国外交部",
        "content": "美国得克萨斯州共和党联邦众议员迈克·麦考尔（Michael McCaul）近年来频繁采取干涉中国内政、损害中方利益的言行，并于近期率团窜访中国台湾地区，严重违反一个中国原则和中美三个联合公报规定，严重损害中国主权和领土完整，向\"台独\"分裂势力发出严重错误信号。\n\n依据《中华人民共和国反外国制裁法》第三条、第四条、第六条、第十五条规定，中方决定对麦考尔采取以下反制措施：\n\n一、冻结在我国境内的动产、不动产和其他各类财产；\n二、禁止我国境内的组织、个人与其进行有关交易、合作等活动；\n三、对其本人不予签发签证、不准入境。\n\n本决定自2023年4月13日起施行。\n\n附件：反制清单\n\n外交部\n2023年4月13日\n\n附件\n反制清单\n\n美国得克萨斯州共和党联邦众议员迈克·麦考尔（Michael McCaul），男\n",
        "language": "zh-CN"
      },
      "legal_citations": [
        {
          "legal_instrument_id": "https://www.ammitto.org/legal-instrument/cn/npc-anti-foreign-sanctions-law",
          "articles": [
            "第三条",
