            {
              "value": "The US recently announced again the sale of weapons to China's Taiwan region, seriously violating the One-China principle and the three China-US joint communiqués, seriously interfering in China's internal affairs, and seriously damaging China's sovereignty and territorial integrity.",
              "lang": "en",
              "script": "Latn",
              "is_primary": false
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
