      "announcement": {
        "title": "关于对美国军工相关企业及高级管理人员采取反制措施的决定",
        "url": "https://www.mfa.gov.cn/web/wjb_673085/zfxxgk_674865/gknrlb/fzcqdcs/202512/t20251226_11787617.shtml",
